.TH EMPTYFOLDERS 1 "2026-11-01" "emptyfolders 2.2" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
emptyfolders \- find and optionally delete empty folders
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B emptyfolders.py
[\fB\-hvl\fR] [\fB\-dp\fR | \fB\-df\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Scans the current directory and all subdirectories bottom-up and lists every
folder that is empty. A folder is empty if it has no content, contains only
\fIThumbs.db\fR, \fI.DS_Store\fR and/or \fI.localized\fR, or contains only
folders that are themselves empty. Symbolic links are never followed and the
starting directory is never reported or deleted.
.PP
System folders are skipped: \fI$RECYCLE.BIN\fR and \fISystem Volume Information\fR
(Windows), \fI.Trash\fR and \fI.Trashes\fR (macOS). A folder that contains one
is not considered empty.
.PP
Without a delete option nothing is changed. All options are case-insensitive.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-dp ", " \-\-delete\-prompt ", " \-\-prompt
Delete empty folders, asking for confirmation for each one.
.TP
.BR \-df ", " \-\-delete\-force ", " \-\-force
Delete empty folders without asking. Mutually exclusive with \fB\-dp\fR.
.TP
.BR \-l ", " \-\-log
Append a full activity log to \fIscan.log\fR.
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-? ", " \-\-help
Show detailed help and exit.
.TP
.BR \-v ", " \-\-version
Show version and exit.
.SH DELETING
Only \fIThumbs.db\fR, \fI.DS_Store\fR and \fI.localized\fR are removed from a
folder before the folder itself is removed. If other content is found the folder
is kept and an error is logged. Deleted folders cannot be restored; run without
a delete option first and review \fIempty\-folders.txt\fR.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I empty\-folders.txt
Always written. One empty folder per line.
.TP
.I folders\-with\-issues.txt
Created only if folders could not be read.
.TP
.I errors.log
Created only if warnings or errors occurred; appended to.
.TP
.I scan.log
Created only with \fB\-\-log\fR; appended to.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 on success, 1 if some folders could not be read, 2 for invalid usage.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
emptyfolders.py
emptyfolders.py \-\-delete\-prompt
emptyfolders.py \-DF \-L
.fi
